# Pokemon Battle Simulator - Project Overview

## What This Project Does

Large-scale Pokemon Showdown simulations: trainer vs trainer, Pokemon vs leaders. Parses results to PNG/CSV. Web UI for config, team building, and running simulations.

## Codebase Structure

```
Pokemon_Trainer_Tournament_Simulator/
├── app.py                    # Flask entry point
├── src/
│   ├── config.py             # Paths, config loading
│   ├── security.py           # Validation, path sanitization
│   ├── services.py           # Script execution, task state
│   └── routes/
│       ├── pages.py          # Page routes (index)
│       └── api.py            # API routes
├── frontend/                 # React + Vite + Tailwind SPA
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/       # React components
│   │   ├── context/          # AppContext
│   │   ├── api.ts            # API client
│   │   └── lib/utils.ts      # cn() utility
│   └── dist/                 # Built SPA (served by Flask)
├── Data/                     # Simulator scripts, inputs, outputs
│   ├── Inputs/               # Input files (configurable)
│   ├── Outputs/              # Generated outputs
│   └── UsefulDatasets/       # Dex fetch script
└── pokemon-showdown/         # Modified sim submodule
```

## Run Commands

- **Production**: `python app.py` (serves from `frontend/dist/`)
- **Dev**: `npm run dev` (root) runs Flask + Vite concurrently
- **Dex data**: `cd Data/UsefulDatasets && python fetch_dex_data.py`

## Do Not Modify

- `pokemon-showdown/` except for documented sim modifications
- Existing API contracts without updating frontend `api.ts`
